kernel-spec/webidl — Mozilla WebIDL definitions (MPL-2.0)
==========================================================

Copied from `riscv-compilers/libwasm/webidl/definitions` (Gecko-style
WebIDL). Each file keeps its Mozilla Public License 2.0 header.

These files are a **spec of record** for the BIOS lightweight browser
(`g6b-webidl` / `g6b-dom` / `g6b-js`). They are not compiled, flisted, or
linked. First-party stubs and live interfaces are MIT in `crates/**`.

Do not relicense. Do not strip MPL headers (E-UPSTREAMWRITE analog).
